{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o025a","title":"陈矫谏止曹仁曹仁突围救牛金众获嘉转封","accounts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o025a-account","label":"《诸夏侯曹传第九》正文","text":"陈矫谏止曹仁曹仁突围救牛金众获嘉转封","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o025a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0072","role":"谏止赞勇","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o025a-q"]},{"person":"cao-ren","role":"突围救军","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o025a-q"]},{"person":"xiahoucao-p0037","role":"获救","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o025a-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"嘉封","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o025a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"牛金被围时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o025a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"xiahoucao-e-o025a-q","source_order":[9,121,"O025a"],"order":2184}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"cao-ren","name":"曹仁","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0072","name":"陈矫","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xiahoucao-p0037","name":"牛金","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o025a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-1ae192c9a134147346cb","layer":"original","quote":"长史陈矫俱在城上，望见金等垂没〖6〗，左右皆失色。仁意气奋怒甚，谓左右：“取马来！”矫等共援持之〖7〗，谓仁曰：“贼众盛，不可当也！假使弃数百人何苦〖8〗？而将军以身赴之！”仁不应，遂被甲上马，将其麾下壮士数十骑出城。去贼百余步，迫沟〖9〗。矫等以为仁当住沟上，为金形势也〖10〗；仁径渡沟，直前，冲入贼围，金等乃得解；余众未尽出，仁复直还突之；拔出金兵，亡其数人，贼众乃退。矫等初见仁出，皆惧；及见仁还，乃叹曰：“将军真天人也！”三军服其勇。太祖益壮之，转封安平亭侯。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":120,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":235}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
